{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17263","headline":"送密秀才吏部駮放後归蜀应崔大理序 · 权德舆","name":"送密秀才吏部駮放後归蜀应崔大理序","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀国本多士，雄文似相如。\n之子西南秀，名在贤能书。\n薄禄且未及，故山念归欤。\n迢迢三千里，返驾一羸车。\n玉垒长路尽，锦江春物余。\n此行无愠色，知尔恋林庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}